OL,3,GNEWSATemporary chief constable set for
OL,4,Apermanent role
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe temporary Chief Constable of
OL,7,FLeicestershire Police is set to be
OL,8,Fappointed to the role on a permanent
OL,9,Fbasis.
OL,11,FDavid Sandall took on the force's top
OL,12,Fjob on a temporary basis in March last
OL,13,Fyear while police and crime
OL,14,Fcommissioner (PCC) Rupert Matthews
OL,15,Flooked to recruit a full-time
OL,16,Freplacement for previous Chief
OL,17,FConstable Rob Nixon, who retired.
OL,19,FMatthews has now said he wants Sandall
OL,20,Fto continue in the post and has named
OL,21,Fhim as his preferred candidate for the
OL,22,Fposition.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
