OL,3,GNEWSATemporary chief constable set for
OL,4,Apermanent role
OL,5,
OL,6,FSandall, who joined Leicestershire
OL,7,FPolice in 1999, said he was "extremely
OL,8,Fhonoured" to be considered for the
OL,9,Fpost.
